        "quote": "胎动比平时减少本身就属于需要警惕的异常信号"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00169",
        "explanation": "Medication safety was weakened by advising a specific dose before verification.",
        "quote": "还没核对到既往处方和甲功"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00107",
        "explanation": "The doctor adapted communication to what the caregiver could say and show at triage.",
        "quote": "产检本和优甲乐药盒一起交给分诊护士"
      }
    ]
  },
