          "quote": "还是以前调过量"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "A misunderstanding about safe levothyroxine handling was triggered, but the doctor’s response remained within basic medication safety and was partly undermined by unverified one-tablet dosing advice; it did not provide a clean beyond-minimum replacement model.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
