          "explanation": "The doctor proposed combining high-risk obstetric review, thyroid testing, prescription renewal, and fetal ultrasound planning in one near-term visit.",
          "quote": "同时开甲功复查来调整优甲乐剂量、续方开药"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00191",
          "explanation": "The doctor converted the caregiver’s uncertainty into a short list of questions for the treating team.",
          "quote": "把这三个问题问清楚"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "Despite the medication dosing flaw, the doctor actively helped the family navigate scattered records, triage, hospital workflow, and follow-up questions in a way that materially improved execution.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
